    "Details": "'Balam', the seventh alternative, is also the first of two loadouts that mounts a weapon acquired during raids of RISC factories; a Heavy MRM-45 launcher. It further carries the Word developed Astral Hammer autocannon, Snubnose PPCs and even two Streak SRM-6 launchers and two Medum Pulse Lasers for shorter ranges. It is also the only configuration to carry an Anti-Missile System.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Wrath of Blake</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.39</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
